  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package frozen peach slices",
    "0.5 cup honey",
    "2 tablespoons cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat a grill for medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_j5FiqtzHkaWRKp3kFSINt1wd7E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-86443-sweet-grilled-peaches-VAT-step-01-2c7ac9b18541493fb8bb9bd2da42777c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/86443/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place peaches onto a large piece of aluminum foil. Use two if necessary to hold in all of the peaches without spillage. Drizzle the honey over the peaches, and sprinkle with cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e-A99rGHaibxDpIGR9fmr16pF7M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-86443-sweet-grilled-peaches-VAT-step-02-25d6ee0f8f4d4f6099a95994c9fa2482.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/86443/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close up the foil, sealing tightly. Place the foil packet onto the preheated grill, and cook for 10 minutes, turning once halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fcok1WQdi5X-xJl2f1aXw4bsSj0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-86443-sweet-grilled-peaches-VAT-step-03-efc334d5e7694db8b199272dc5558262.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/86443/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully open the packet, and serve.",
